        {
            "id": "7013ac72-e5fd-4540-aceb-a0eb52f257b8",
            "build_id": "8c518cbd-fda8-4f0b-9f6d-28c78fca1ac3",
            "round_number": 5,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-08-29T22:47:37.884668+00:00",
            "notes": "If you took  [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) round 1, then it's time to pick up  [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) which will supercharge everything you're already built.  But if you took  [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) then this is where you take the shield throw -- it's a lot of extra ability damage and Inspire procs.\n\n[Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) is the next upgrade, as mentioned.  This is the full sustain package.  \n\nSo just to recap, we get \n* 5% of max life from Aura Farming any time we deal ability damage\n* +25 from Exhaust Ports per ability \n* 2.5% of max life per second with Gloomgauntlet\n* ~17 armor per second from Lumerico \n\nAND we have Inspire healing on top of that, AND we have a shield and a tank-sized healthpool, AND during rally we have even more health and Inspire procs and ability cooldowns.\n\nThere's only one piece missing which we'll pick up in Round 6 (or if you're flooded with cash round 5).  But make sure your item slots are filled out, and pick up survivability Blues if you need them (unlikely).",
