            "notes": "Powers have mostly been covered already, but you could consider  [Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753) for the AOE it gives your Bash.\n\nOtherwise I've shown the full, unlimited budget item selections.  If you don't have the cash to buy all of them, refer to previous rounds for alternatives.   [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) is also an interesting choice for the brawly playstyle, giving a lot of movespeed and offensive stats, especially if you picked Burst Aid for your Power.  There's a lot of options for the last one or two slots,  [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) is another one that gives you more control over the battlefield, or there's plenty of ways to take your tankiness even further.  Pick what seems best to you!",
